      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008093266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Connecting you to a Returns Specialist now.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008093999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is David. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008097066665
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 25899,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008103266665
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Could I get your name and order number to pull up your account?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008105266665
    },
    {
      "text": "Jane Doe. Order number is VF789012.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 25899,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008111799998
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Jane. One moment... Okay, I see your order for the Aero-Mesh jersey, delivered about 39 days ago. Is that the item you're calling about?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008114333331
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. The jersey.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 25899,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008124333331
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright. And to make sure I'm routing this correctly, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault with the material or more a matter of preference with the fit?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008125599997
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the wrong size. It's just too tight. Your sizing chart must be for children.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 25899,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008137266663
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear it didn't fit as you expected. We could certainly process an exchange for a larger size if you'd like. I can get that started for you right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008142866663
    },
    {
      "text": "No. I just want my money back.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 25899,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008153866663
    },
    {
      "text": "Not a problem at all. Let me just confirm our policy for you... Yes, I see here that standard items are eligible for return within 10 days of delivery. You are unfortunately outside that window, so I cannot approve this for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008156066663
    },
    {
      "text": "Amazing. Must be my lucky day.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 25899,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008171466663
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just sent a prepaid return label to the email we have on file. Simply print that out, attach it to the package, and drop it off. Once our warehouse receives the item, a full refund will be issued to your original form of payment.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008173666663
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. Whatever.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 25899,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008189466663
    },
    {
      "text": "Is there anything else I can help you with today, Jane?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769008190666663
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
